{"seq":2,"slug":"pytest","title":"测试框架 pytest","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/engineering/pytest","wordCount":1031,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"测试框架-pytest\">测试框架 pytest</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>pytest 是 Python 最流行的测试框架。相比标准库 unittest，pytest 语法更简洁、功能更强大——fixture 依赖注入、参数化测试、丰富的插件生态，让编写和维护测试变得高效。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>pytest 的三种机制分别解决了测试的三个常见难题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>解决的难题</th>\n<th>关键点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>原生 <code>assert</code></td>\n<td>断言的失败信息不足</td>\n<td>AST 重写自动展开中间值，显示 <code>a=2, b=1</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fixture 依赖注入</td>\n<td>测试间共享 setup 代码</td>\n<td>按参数名注入，<code>yield</code> 前 setup 后 teardown</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@parametrize</code></td>\n<td>用少量代码覆盖输入组合</td>\n<td>多个装饰器叠加产生笛卡尔积</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>贯穿其中的一条纪律是<strong>测试分层</strong>：单元测试（每次提交、目标 &gt;80%）→ 集成测试（每次 PR、覆盖关键路径）→ 端到端测试（发布前、核心场景）。层级越靠下越快、越独立，越靠上越慢、越真实——据此分配运行频率才能在反馈速度与信心中取得平衡。覆盖率只是下限指标，应配合 <code>--cov-branch</code> 检测条件分支，而非单纯追求百分比。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"基本用法\">基本用法</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def add(a: int, b: int) -&gt; int:&#10;    return a + b&#10;&#10;def test_add():&#10;    assert add(1, 2) == 3&#10;    assert add(-1, 1) == 0&#10;    assert add(0, 0) == 0\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(a: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, b: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> test_add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> add(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> add(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> add(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"pytest tests/ -v&#10;pytest tests/test_core.py::test_add&#10;pytest -x  # 遇到第一个失败即停止&#10;pytest -k &quot;test_add or test_sub&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pytest</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tests/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -v</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pytest</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tests/test_core.py::test_add</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pytest</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -x</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 遇到第一个失败即停止</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pytest</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -k</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"test_add or test_sub\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>pytest 最大的优势之一是使用原生 <code>assert</code> 语句而非 <code>self.assertEqual()</code> 等方法。当 assert 失败时，pytest 通过 AST 重写技术自动展开表达式的中间值，例如 <code>assert a + b == 5</code> 失败时会显示 <code>a=2, b=1</code>，无需手动编写错误消息。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"fixture-依赖注入\">Fixture 依赖注入</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import pytest&#10;&#10;@pytest.fixture&#10;def sample_users():&#10;    return [&#10;        {&quot;name&quot;: &quot;Alice&quot;, &quot;age&quot;: 30},&#10;        {&quot;name&quot;: &quot;Bob&quot;, &quot;age&quot;: 25},&#10;    ]&#10;&#10;@pytest.fixture&#10;def db_connection():&#10;    conn = create_connection()&#10;    yield conn&#10;    conn.close()&#10;&#10;def test_user_count(sample_users):&#10;    assert len(sample_users) == 2&#10;&#10;def test_query(db_connection):&#10;    result = db_connection.execute(&quot;SELECT 1&quot;)&#10;    assert result is not None\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pytest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@pytest.fixture</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sample_users</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Alice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"age\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Bob\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"age\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@pytest.fixture</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> db_connection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    conn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> create_connection()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    yield</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> conn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    conn.close()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> test_user_count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sample_users):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sample_users) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> test_query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(db_connection):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db_connection.execute(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SELECT 1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"fixture-作用域\">Fixture 作用域</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>作用域</th>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>生命周期</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>function</td>\n<td><code>scope=&quot;function&quot;</code></td>\n<td>每个测试函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>class</td>\n<td><code>scope=&quot;class&quot;</code></td>\n<td>每个测试类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>module</td>\n<td><code>scope=&quot;module&quot;</code></td>\n<td>每个测试模块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>session</td>\n<td><code>scope=&quot;session&quot;</code></td>\n<td>整个测试会话</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Fixture 的 <code>yield</code> 语法是资源管理的关键模式——<code>yield</code> 之前的代码是 setup，之后的代码是 teardown。这比 unittest 的 <code>setUp/tearDown</code> 更加直观，并且 fixture 之间可以自由组合。例如一个 <code>db_connection</code> fixture 可以被 <code>db_session</code> fixture 使用，实现层级化的资源管理。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"参数化测试\">参数化测试</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import pytest&#10;&#10;@pytest.mark.parametrize(&quot;input,expected&quot;, [&#10;    (1, 1),&#10;    (2, 4),&#10;    (3, 9),&#10;    (-1, 1),&#10;    (0, 0),&#10;])&#10;def test_square(input, expected):&#10;    assert input ** 2 == expected&#10;&#10;@pytest.mark.parametrize(&quot;x&quot;, [1, 2, 3])&#10;@pytest.mark.parametrize(&quot;y&quot;, [10, 20])&#10;def test_multiply(x, y):&#10;    assert x * y &gt; 0\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pytest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@pytest.mark.parametrize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"input,expected\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> test_square</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(input, expected):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> input</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> **</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expected</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@pytest.mark.parametrize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"x\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@pytest.mark.parametrize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"y\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> test_multiply</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x, y):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span></code></pre></div><p>多个 <code>@parametrize</code> 装饰器叠加时会产生笛卡尔积——上面的 <code>test_multiply</code> 会生成 6 个测试用例（3 x 2）。这种方式在测试矩阵组合（如不同数据库引擎 × 不同操作类型）时非常高效。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"异常与警告测试\">异常与警告测试</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import pytest&#10;&#10;def divide(a: int, b: int) -&gt; float:&#10;    if b == 0:&#10;        raise ValueError(&quot;Cannot divide by zero&quot;)&#10;    return a / b&#10;&#10;def test_divide_by_zero():&#10;    with pytest.raises(ValueError, match=&quot;Cannot divide by zero&quot;):&#10;        divide(1, 0)&#10;&#10;def test_deprecation_warning():&#10;    with pytest.warns(DeprecationWarning):&#10;        old_function()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color